{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RCA so far: observation: review-bot was process-healthy and /health returned 200 while Gerrit authentication paths needed for vote casting were returning 401. Working comparison: after resetting the Gerrit service account HTTP password to the SSM token, /a/accounts/self and /a/plugins/events-log/events/ returned 200 and the same bot process could vote on change 2801. Hypothesis confirmed: the secret rotation updated SSM/container .env but did not leave Gerrit's service-account HTTP password and the rendered refs/meta/config webhook secret in sync with that token; the health endpoint only checked process liveness/queue counters, not Gerrit auth/vote-casting capability. Fix direction implemented in worktree blackfly-healthcheck: /health now performs a bounded Gerrit auth probe and returns 503 degraded on auth failure."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788830469431627001,"uuid":"437e0f0a-c209-41e6-a95e-23303d52795a"}